aller or borderline, generally with only one direct importer. They are cleanup candidates, not current blast-radius hotspots.\n\nThe key sequencing rule is: preserve public import paths while extracting internals. In particular, immediately splitting `src/utils.ts` and updating all 18 consumers would create more short-term blast radius than it removes.",
